{"t":"Darklight Core","s":"darklight-core-4f9ce","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Walking_Pillar_82926b.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Darklight Core</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Walking Pillar\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Walking_Pillar_82926b.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Northern Darama</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">One of the four hunting areas accessed through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Vestibule\">Blood Vestibule</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"34118,31880,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (34118, 31880, 14)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">13.20.13560<br/>July 10, 2023<br/>Summer Update 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nIt is one of the areas of the <a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a>. The creatures here deal 3 different elemental damages: Energy, <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice</a> (and <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a> for characters under the influence of at least three <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore%27s%20Taints\">Bakragore's Taints</a>), while being sensitive to Earth, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">Physical</a>.\n</p><p>Creatures in the area can put a <a href=\"#/wiki/Darkfield\">Darkfield</a> below characters. It can be compared to a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field\">Fire Field</a> but it deals considerable <a href=\"#/wiki/Agony%20Damage\">Agony Damage</a> instead. A darkfield can only be destroyed through <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Runes</a>, but will always inflict damage on the initial target.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Walking%20Pillar\"><img alt=\"Walking Pillar\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Walking_Pillar_82926b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Walking%20Pillar\">Walking Pillar</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">24,300</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">38,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yellow%20Darklight%20Matter\">Yellow Darklight Matter</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Magma Clump (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Darklight Core (Object) (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Coal\">Coal</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Darklight Basalt Chunk (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Onyx%20Chip\">Onyx Chip</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Strange Helmet (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Sword\">Fire Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>2-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Mana%20Potion\">Ultimate Mana Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Gem\">Blue Gem</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Magma Legs (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Gem\">White Gem</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Source\"><img alt=\"Darklight Source\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darklight_Source_d8fd69.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Source\">Darklight Source</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">22,465</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">31,550</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yellow%20Darklight%20Matter\">Yellow Darklight Matter</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Dark Obsidian Splinter (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Darklight Core (Objec