</span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Matter\">Darklight Matter</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">22,250</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">30,150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Unstable%20Darklight%20Matter\">Unstable Darklight Matter</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Darklight Core (Object) (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-6× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\">Ultimate Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Darklight Matter (Object) (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Rubber Cap (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Collar%20of%20Red%20Plasma\">Collar of Red Plasma</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Gem\">Green Gem</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Shadow Sceptre (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["rotten-blood-quest"]}